<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
<TXSPN>Huh...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just now, someone's voice...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... did you hear something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I heard it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That just now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Grandma's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> voice, that was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had heard it too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> and I stood at the window beside <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One bright thing rode in on the wind and came fluttering down, as if it were being drawn inside.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\花びら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Is this... 
{PAUSE ""}
a cherry petal...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, look at that!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "最後の声編実装用.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On a branch of the withered cherry, I could see something shining brightly in the moonlight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\桜の新芽2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A brand-new little branch had grown on the cherry tree, and out-of-season blossoms were blooming on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How can a withered tree have blossoms...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just a few blossoms, shining dazzlingly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were what was carrying the voice to us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
Once again, the wind blew into the room.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
